<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>ORE - Kadirga-5 - 150,000 tonnes ore Tubarao/Rotterdam 1/15 July $5.90 fio six days shinc Yukong.</p>
<p>Veni - 140,000 tonnes ore Ponta do Ubu/Rotterdam 25 July/5 Aug $6.45 fio six days shinc Bremen Stahlwerke.</p>
<p>Viva - 100,000 tonnes ore Nouadhibou/E.Dunkirk 10/25 July $5.15 fio six days shinc Hanjin.</p>
<p>TBN - 60,000 tonnes ore Orinoco/Mobile end June/early July $6 fio five days shinc Navios.</p>
<p>COAL - There were no fresh coal fixtures reported on Monday.</p>
</text>
